  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n- Opt-in strict mode for unresolved placeholders. Set\n  TemplatedConfigurationOptions.ThrowOnUnresolvedPlaceholders to true to fail\n  fast when a balanced placeholder cannot be resolved: the initial load throws\n  InvalidOperationException naming the configuration key and the unresolved\n  placeholder. The default remains lenient pass-through, and an unbalanced\n  delimiter is always left unchanged. On a later reload an unresolved\n  placeholder does not throw; the provider keeps the previous values and does\n  not signal a reload.",
